</nav>
</div>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section id="beranda" class="py-5">
<div class="container-xl"><div class="row align-items-center g-5">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">Kelola Kantor Notaris dengan Lebih Mudah, Terstruktur, dan Profesional.</h2>
<p class="text-secondary fs-3 mt-3">Platform manajemen kantor Notaris untuk membantu mengelola klien, layanan, dokumen, akta, repertorium, dan administrasi dalam satu sistem terintegrasi.</p>
<div class="mt-4 d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
<a class="btn btn-warning btn-lg" href="/login">Konsultasi Sekarang</a>
<a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg" href="#fitur">Jelajahi Fitur</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6"><img class="img-fluid rounded shadow" style="object-fit:cover;width:100%;height:420px" src="/assets/landing/notarius-hero.png" alt="Meja kerja notaris: dokumen hukum, pena, timbangan keadilan"/></div>
</div></div>
</section>

<section class="py-4 border-top border-bottom"><div class="container-xl"><div class="row text-center g-3 small">
<div class="col-6 col-md"><strong class="d-block">🗂 Semua Terorganisir</strong><span class="text-secondary">Pekerjaan lebih tertata</span></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md"><strong class="d-block">🔍 Riwayat Mudah</strong><span class="text-secondary">Telusuri klien & layanan</span></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md"><strong class="d-block">📁 Dokumen Rapi</strong><span class="text-secondary">Terstruktur & privat</span></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md"><strong class="d-block">📊 Monitoring Jelas</strong><span class="text-secondary">Antrean & piutang</span></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md"><strong class="d-block">⚙ Administrasi</strong><span class="text-secondary">Lebih efisien</span></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="fitur" class="py-5">
<div class="container-xl">
<div class="text-center mb-4"><h2 class="fw-bold">Fitur Unggulan</h2><p class="text-secondary">Satu platform untuk seluruh operasional kantor</p></div>
<div class="row g-3">
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-klien.jpg" alt="Manajemen klien"/></div><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Client Management</h3><p class="text-secondary">Perorangan & badan hukum, identitas terverifikasi manusia, beneficial owner, deteksi duplikat.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Notarial Workflow</h3><p class="text-secondary">Permohonan → pemeriksaan → draft → review → finalisasi → register, tercatat penuh.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-portal.jpg" alt="Alur akta"/></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-akta.jpg" alt="Pengesahan akta"/></div><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Deed Management</h3><p class="text-secondary">Draf berversi dari template terapproved, pengesahan notaris, final terkunci, PDF/DOCX.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Repertorium & Protocol Archive</h3><p class="text-secondary">Nomor unik per kantor, bendel tahunan, retensi 25 tahun, cetak & ekspor CSV.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-repertorium.jpg" alt="Arsip repertorium"/></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-dokumen.jpg" alt="Arsip dokumen"/></div><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Document Management</h3><p class="text-secondary">Document center, upload privat, OCR terverifikasi manusia, riwayat versi.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Financial Management</h3><p class="text-secondary">Invoice multi-baris anti-overpay, pembayaran, piutang, pengeluaran, tarif.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-keuangan.jpg" alt="Keuangan kantor"/></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-laporan.jpg" alt="Laporan bisnis"/></div><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Reporting</h3><p class="text-secondary">Laporan akta, repertorium, layanan, keuangan — dihitung dari data nyata.</p><a href="/login">Buka modul →</a></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="row g-0"><div class="col-8"><div class="card-body"><h3>Keamanan & Portal Klien</h3><p class="text-secondary">MFA, RBAC 9 peran, enkripsi NIK, audit imutabel, portal terisolasi per klien.</p><a href="#keamanan">Pelajari →</a></div></div><div class="col-4"><img class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover" src="/assets/landing/notarius-feat-keamanan.jpg" alt="Keamanan dokumen"/></div></div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="solusi" class="py-5 bg-light border-top border-bottom">
<div class="container-xl">
<div class="text-center mb-4"><h2 class="fw-bold">Manfaat Operasional</h2></div>
<div class="row g-3 text-center">
<div class="col-md"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">📋<strong class="d-block mt-2">Lebih Terorganisir</strong><span class="text-secondary small">Antrean, agenda, dan tugas dalam satu pandang.</span></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">⏱<strong class="d-block mt-2">Lebih Efisien</strong><span class="text-secondary small">Template + repertorium otomatis memangkas admin.</span></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">🔒<strong class="d-block mt-2">Lebih Aman</strong><span class="text-secondary small">Akses berbasis peran, data terisolasi per kantor.</span></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">📈<strong class="d-block mt-2">Terukur</strong><span class="text-secondary small">Keuangan & kinerja dari angka nyata, bukan kira-kira.</span></div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="py-5"><div class="container-xl"><div class="row g-5">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<h2 class="fw-bold">Alur Kerja Notaris</h2>
<div class="list-group mt-3">
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">1</span><strong>Permohonan</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — dicatat beserta persyaratan.</span></div>
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">2</span><strong>Pemeriksaan</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — kelengkapan berkas + verifikasi identitas.</span></div>
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">3</span><strong>Draft</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — dari template terapproved, revisi berversi.</span></div>
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">4</span><strong>Review</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — hanya notaris mengesahkan.</span></div>
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">5</span><strong>Finalisasi</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — terkunci, ekspor berwatermark.</span></div>
<div class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-2">6</span><strong>Register & Arsip</strong><span class="text-secondary"> — repertorium otomatis, protokol, invoice.</span></div>
</div>
<p class="text-secondary small mt-2">Tahapan manual tetap di tangan notaris — sistem mencatat, bukan menggantikan.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6" id="keamanan">
<h2 class="fw-bold">Keamanan Berdasarkan Implementasi Aktual</h2>
<ul class="list-group mt-3">
<li class="list-group-item">🔐 Login bcrypt + sesi server-side + MFA TOTP</li>
<li class="list-group-item">🛡️ RBAC 9 peran / 19 izin + isolasi data per kantor</li>
<li class="list-group-item">🧬 NIK terenkripsi AES-256-GCM, tampil 4 digit akhir</li>
<li class="list-group-item">📜 Audit log imutabel + HSTS + CSP + CSRF + rate-limit</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-secondary small mt-2">Tanpa klaim sertifikasi — keamanan dibuktikan lewat uji.</p>
</div>
</div></div>
</section>

<section id="harga" class="py-5 bg-light border-top">
<div class="container-xl">
<div class="text-center mb-4"><h2 class="fw-bold">Harga</h2><p class="text-secondary">Hubungi kami untuk penawaran resmi sesuai kebutuhan kantor Anda</p></div>
<div class="row g-3">
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body text-center"><h3>Kantor</h3><p class="display-6 fw-bold">Konsultasi</p><p class="text-secondary">Seluruh modul operasional satu kantor.</p><a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100">Minta Penawaran</a></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="ribbon bg-yellow">Populer</div><div class="card-body text-center"><h3>Korporat</h3><p class="display-6 fw-bold">Konsultasi</p><p class="text-secondary">Multi-pengguna, portal klien, prioritas dukungan.</p><a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-warning w-100">Minta Penawaran</a></div></div></div>
<div class="col-md-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body text-center"><h3>Enterprise</h3><p class="display-6 fw-bold">Konsultasi</p><p class="text-secondary">On-premise, retensi arsip, SLA, audit khusus.</p><a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100">Hubungi Kami</a></div></div></div>
</div>
<p class="text-secondary small text-center mt-3">Harga final lewat penawaran resmi — tanpa angka mengada-ada.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="py-5"><div class="container-xl" style="max-width:760px">
<h2 class="fw-bold text-center mb-4">Pertanyaan Umum</h2>
<div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><details><summary class="fw-bold">Apakah SaktiNotaris pengganti PPAT / advokat?</summary><p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Bukan. Hanya untuk layanan jabatan Notaris Indonesia.</p></details></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><details><summary class="fw-bold">Apakah terhubung ke AHU/OSS resmi?</summary><p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Tidak ada API resmi yang diklaim. Modul bersifat asistensi: checklist + arsip bukti pengisian manual.</p></details></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><details><summary class="fw-bold">Bagaimana keamanan data NIK klien?</summary><p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Terenkripsi AES-256-GCM; tampil 4 digit akhir. OCR tidak pernah auto-verify.</p></details></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><details><summary class="fw-bold">Apakah bisa multi-kantor?</summary><p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Ya — isolasi per kantor di sisi server (office_id).</p></details></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><details><summary class="fw-bold">Bagaimana backup data?</summary><p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Skrip backup GPG + restore di <code>deploy/</code>. Uji restore wajib sebelum produksi.</p></details></div></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="bg-dark text-white py-5">
<div class="container-xl"><div class="row align-items-center g-5">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<h2 class="fw-bold">Mulai Kelola Kantor Notaris Anda dengan Lebih Terstruktur.</h2>
<p class="text-white-50">Fokus pada pelayanan hukum — kami yang mengurus teknologi.</p>
<a class="btn btn-warning btn-lg mt-2" href="/login">Konsultasi Sekarang</a>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6"><img class="img-fluid rounded shadow" style="object-fit:cover;width:100%;height:300px" src="/assets/landing/notarius-office.png" alt="Kantor notaris modern"/></div>
</div></div>
</section>
</main>

<footer id="kontak" class="py-4 border-top">
<div class="container-xl">
<div class="row g-3 small">
<div class="col-md-3"><strong>SaktiNotaris</strong><p class="text-secondary">Digital. Profesional. Terpercaya.</p></div>
